<title>UK: Bouygues to launch 1.5 bln FFR domestic.</title>
<headline>Bouygues to launch 1.5 bln FFR domestic.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bouygues will launch a 1.5 billion French franc seven-year domestic bond on Thursday, Banque Nationale de Paris and Credit Lyonnais said on Wednesday as joint lead managers, having been awarded the mandate. The deal will be priced 46-48 basis points over the OAT curve. The maturity date is January 6, 2004. The payment date is January 6, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
